      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I could see this, yes.  with VRchat growing ever bigger.  It's limiting that only the first 32 or 64 (...though CPU limits be an issue) people will be the only ones who get to see.  Eventually it'll only be streamers will be allowed, and kinda takes away from the whole VR experience if you're just watching someone else's perspective.\n\nI would like to see the main performance, and we can then watch with perhaps a group of friends to enjoy it with.  where we can talk among ourselves... though would make interaction with the performer a bit more difficult, especially volunteer like events.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
