  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-25T16:22:13.991Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is something that I know VRChat was interested in before Altspace even existed, but I'm curious if it's being actively worked on.  \n\nBasically I want to be able to broadcast a performance in every instance of a room.  Something like Front Row although I'd settle for something simpler.  Also this seems essential now if we ever want another Town Hall, unless you sell tickets.",
